direction: down
title: "C23 RC reader grace: metadata lifetime and fatal custody"
"Live VM / closed round" -> "Lookup lease": "before task-origin-context metadata loads"
"Lookup lease" -> "Claim owner": "no unowned interval on success"
"Lookup lease" -> "Failed-claim exit": "no context pointee access after failure; metadata grace still required"
"Claim owner" -> "RC scan gate": "strong phase only; normal return discharges slot access"
"RC scan gate" -> "Diagnostic capture": "address-only record; fatal does not unwind gate normally"
"Diagnostic capture" -> "Retained fault custody": "escaped/unknown hook cannot issue normal completion"
"Failed-claim exit" -> "Domain retirement": "all old readers drained, not merely claim DONE"
"RC scan gate" -> "Node unlink": "same-gate scan grace; independent of failed metadata lookup"
"Root task DONE" -> "Descendant scan work": "DONE precedes mark_reachable_from_marked; no phase grace yet"
"Descendant scan work" -> "Physical cohort drain": "all admitted lookups, claims and descendants must finish"
"Physical cohort drain" -> "Domain retirement": "live coordinator issues combined metadata grace; root/origin duties remain"
